SYSTEMS & EMBEDDED
------------------

* LOTA
  Transparent system integrity framework for Linux.
  https://github.com/szymonwilczek/lota

* Talos 7
  Programmable macro keyboard I built using RP2040 and an OLED screen.
  https://github.com/szymonwilczek/talos-7

* alloyctl
  Control utility & interactive TUI for SteelSeries mice on Linux.
  https://github.com/szymonwilczek/alloyctl

* Asmodeus
  Custom 16-bit virtual machine with its own Polish assembly language.
  https://github.com/szymonwilczek/asmodeus


LINUX DESKTOP
-------------

* Carmenta
  Minimal Emoji Picker written in Rust & GTK4.
  https://github.com/szymonwilczek/carmenta

* Hati
  Wayland cursor highlighter for presentations and screen recording.
  https://github.com/szymonwilczek/hati


DEV TOOLS
---------

* vim-be-better
  Neovim plugin that gamifies learning motion keys. Fork of vim-be-good.
  https://github.com/szymonwilczek/vim-be-better

* tmux-jot
  Tmux popup note manager serving as sticky notes. 
  https://github.com/szymonwilczek/tmux-jot

* jot.el
  Emacs floating child-frame note manager serving as sticky notes.
  https://github.com/szymonwilczek/jot.el

* bufferline.el
  Buffer line for GNU Emacs built on tab-line-mode.
  https://github.com/szymonwilczek/bufferline.el


